Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.49,0:00:04.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  經PLANT最高評議會全議員表決
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:08.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同意國防委員會的提案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:12.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極行使自衛權
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:15.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然話是這麼說 但戰爭是多變的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:20.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,濺出的火花會擴散到何種地步 誰也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:25.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要和大西洋聯邦締結同盟條約
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 雖然仍未接到命令
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:34.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva明晨出航  通告全艦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們到底要任性妄為到什麼地步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:39.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:42.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是變成敵人  這次就讓我來毀滅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:44.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種國家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:46.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,優しいその指が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終わりに触れる時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今だけ　君だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,信じても言いいだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰もね崩れてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願いの求め過ぎて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分が落ちて行く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,場所を捜してる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傷つけて 揺れるしか出来ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ざわめく想いが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らの真実なら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壊れる地から動けない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,淋しい羽根重ねて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出逢う光の無い 時代の眩しさだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,変われる地から恐れない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深い鼓動の先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交わす炎よ描かれた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命に届け
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:18.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Spear of Twilight作戰計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始前60秒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.18,0:02:23.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射角度微調 0.3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:27.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧瑟  德瑪尼西  卡湯達  各隊完成發射準備
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:29.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,半徑600以內無敵影
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:30.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續倒數計時
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:31.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,倒數5秒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.33,0:02:32.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:33.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:34.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始降下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:37.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始降下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:42.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,300)\fn华文宋体\fs40\b1\3c&H000000&\pos(866,664)}地球军 舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.74,0:02:44.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發佈反空降動員令  全員第一級戰鬥配置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:46.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複  全員第一級戰鬥配置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:46.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:48.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是ZAFT的降下部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.33,0:03:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs40\b1\3c&H000000&\pos(644,706)}{\fad(100,300)}ZAFT軍卡潘塔利亞基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:24.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva出航了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:27.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs38\b1\3c&H000000&\pos(970,666)}{\fad(100,300)}奧布軍戰鬥指揮所
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說是艘很快的高速艦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就會駛出領海吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和那邊的聯絡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是  已完成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:36.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的配置結束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:37.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將離開奧布領海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,降下作戰不知如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和卡潘塔利亞還聯繫不上？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:52.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然一直在呼叫...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:59.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦前方22  大量熱紋反應
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:03.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…地球軍艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Spengler級4 Daniloff級8
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其他還有10艘左右的中小艦艇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在本艦前方左右展開
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:24.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛出奧布的領海就…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是在埋伏本艦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:30.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍沒有全去卡潘塔利亞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:34.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,後方奧布領海前出現奧布艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:36.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,展開中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:49.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,炮塔回轉  正瞄準本艦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:55.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不允許返回領海
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來被當成見面禮之類的東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還未正式簽訂條約吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有一手嘛  奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:11.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:15.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是  多說無益
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:19.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發佈紅色狀態  艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:21.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對艦  對MS戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:24.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大氣層內戰鬥  阿瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:27.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:29.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發佈紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發佈紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員請在機體內待命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色  為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:40.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道  為什麼問我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:46.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長塔利雅 庫拉提斯向Minerva全部乘員通話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:48.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最終檢查  趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:52.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs30\pos(638,664)}本艦前方是由四艘航母構成的地球軍艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:58.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而後方是守衛本國領海的奧布軍艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:00.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,四艘航母？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,背後是奧布？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:06.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍似乎得知本艦出航  張網恭候多時
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:10.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布又關閉了後方的大門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:15.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們只有突破前方地球軍艦隊一條活路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:21.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來的戰鬥將會前所未有的慘烈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:25.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦無論如何必須殺出一條血路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:32.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望以身為Minerva乘員為榮  堅持到底不言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:33.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:55.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管2 7全門裝填Parsifal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS Tristan Isolde啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:07.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴真出擊後別離船太遠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:11.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷和露娜負責在甲板狙擊上空MS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:12.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:16.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Isolde和Tristan集中火力攻擊左舷巡洋艦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:17.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突破左側
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:18.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:20.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器推力正常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:21.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線清理完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:23.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機出擊  請
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:29.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  核心戰機出動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku 雷 查 巴勒路機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.61,0:07:36.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.07,0:07:37.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始出擊程序
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:42.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅機  出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為Zaku裝備炮裝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:51.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別落下海  露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下去可沒功夫救你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:55.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壞心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:08:01.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們親眼証實一下羅阿諾克的報告吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:31.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Isolde 發射口1-4 Parsifal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:32.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:51.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉 羅馬呢  在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:53.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,軍總部?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:56.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼在那種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不用了 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:08:59.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:11.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,3點方向MS接近  數量3
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避  左舵10
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:30.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰會…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:39.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願意死在這裡!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:47.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:53.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又有人在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:07.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:10.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼又會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,5點方向導彈接近  數量眾多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避  右舵20  迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說  這種數量  開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你還有空廢話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:59.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs40\b1\3c&H000000&\pos(908,666)}{\fad(100,300)}地球军 旗舰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:58.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  這艘船的確有一手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zamza-Zah怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:05.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,獵物太弱的話拍出的影像也沒震撼力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:08.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是  準備完成後就令其出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:10.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許是個人偏愛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:15.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為今後的主力應該是那種新型MA
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:20.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是那種模仿ZAFT製造,蜻蜒似的MS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zulu 01升起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:27.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,B80要員完成誘導後在機庫待機
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:29.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線清理完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:30.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,允許出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:40.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未知機體接近  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:42.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,顯示光學影像
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:46.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:48.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MA
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真夠大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被那種東西靠上的話就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:55.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑟  啟動Tannhuser
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:58.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把左前方的艦隊和那東西一起掃清
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:00.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想被擊沉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:02.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是  啊,不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tannhuser啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,轉移為控制射線軸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:09.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準  敵方MA
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:13.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認敵艦陽電子炮發射準備狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:15.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,陽電子反射器  準備展開
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:18.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,朝向敵艦反射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:26.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把Tannhuser彈開了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵20 引擎最大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:59.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan瞄準  左舷敵艦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:02.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是艦長  那個東西怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:05.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也給我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪瑞克  迴避交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:07.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳  真能回來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:11.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:14.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主炮一號二號瞄準敵艦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:21.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  什麼怪傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:25.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,鉤爪展開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:26.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,鉤爪展開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:36.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把這種孱弱的身體撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那兵器真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然彈開了陽電子炮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:45.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:47.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉  這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:53.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva在作戰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:54.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是和地球軍？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:57.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  在奧布的領海外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,面對那種大軍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:02.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心  卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,領海線上已經派出了護衛艦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:09.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為雖然是領海外  但很近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:10.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傷腦筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:15.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs40\b1\pos(956,666)}{\fad(100,300)}奧布軍艦隊 旗艦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不打算讓他們進領海嗎  Minerva他們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:15.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣根本無處可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:18.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是奧布的規則吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:22.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  雖然還未正武簽署
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:27.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經決定與大西洋聯邦締結同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:32.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們現在該以何種姿態應對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:36.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這點事你也知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:37.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那艘船是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:39.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是ZAFT的艦船
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:45.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與即將成為盟友的大西洋聯邦敵對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:51.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan發射
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:58.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是什麼火力和能量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse的能量進入危險區域
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,7點方向MS 4
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:09.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:20.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva繼續接近領海線
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:23.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去數分鐘內將侵犯領海
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,警告後進行恐嚇射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:27.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓他們進領海
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:30.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如不停下的話允許攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:31.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:33.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,國家不是你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:38.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再說感情用事的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:43.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與以前踐踏國土的軍隊為友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:47.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,討伐努力拯救地球的艦船
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:53.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,除了「忘恩負義」別無言語可以形容了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:58.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許政治中根本沒有這個詞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:02.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始警告  炮口朝向Minerva的船首前方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不准打中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:06.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令  這樣與命令…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:09.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才不管呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是政治家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:19.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向ZAFT軍艦Minerva通話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:23.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,貴艦正接近奧布聯合首長國的領海
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:26.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我國不容許貴艦進入領海
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,必須立刻轉向
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:30.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:31.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:35.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在轉向的話肯定被擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,維持航向  最大限度逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:39.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主炮發射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:58.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布  真打算…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:02.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:17.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為這點事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:42.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為這點事我不能…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:48.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不下去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:55.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva  梅琳  發射氘核光束
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:18:00.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後準備射出腿部部件和Sword Silhouette
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:01.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快  能做到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:04.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:06.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,照他說的做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:07.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:10.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氘核操作室準備
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,索敵追蹤系統捕捉到Impulse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氘核光束照射
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:27.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:30.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:49.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,射出Silhouette
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:50.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:52.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:16.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:18.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍艦隊撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:41.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上這個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:45.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是FAITH？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:50.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想把你安排進普通的指揮系統
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:51.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不願意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:54.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為方便起見
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:59.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,宣誓效忠的部隊被稱為FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:03.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需對自己的信念效忠便可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:05.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:10.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是遵循自己信念  不安於現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:14.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在需要的時候能挺身而出與之抗爭的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:18.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我的努力方向
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:20.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你能夠做到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:25.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請在認為需要的時候使用這種力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:29.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說得大些  不只為ZAFT和PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了大家能和平生活的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:39.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.99,0:21:45.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想必奧布的情況也讓你很擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:48.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你就去和Minerva會合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.77,0:21:52.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我對那艘船有很大期望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:58.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能發揮以前大天使號那樣的作用
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.07,0:22:02.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也助她一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉 Savior出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,言葉を重ねても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,分かり合えないこと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,まだ知らなかったね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君だけを抱きしめたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失くした夢　君は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「諦メナイデ」と云った
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遠く離れてるほどに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,近くに感じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,寂しさも 強さへと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,變わってく 君を思ったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,切なく胸を刺す
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それは夢の欠片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ありのまま  出逢えてた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,その奇跡  もう一度信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:24.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得到的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:29.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了保護什麼  做到什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,度過混亂的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:36.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但籠罩著世界的新的黑暗
